Z||000000||Kelvin Vivian||01-14-2001||03:46 AM||||Just like to say hello to all the other fiero enthusiasts out there. I love restoring Fieros, and it's fun for us do-it-yourselfers. I will be attending the 2001 San Francisco Bay Area Fiero fest to show off the two Fieros I own. Both are rare Fiero models. I am looking forward to the event as it will be my first "Fiero Event".<P>1988 GT - Factory options: Red exterior, beechwood int. with tan leather seats (need to be restored), 5-spd, AC, PMirrors, PLocks, PWindows, Rear Defrost, Spoiler, T-tops. 138,000 miles<P>1987 SE - Factory options: Medium Red Metallic ext., Grey int., 5-spd, 4-cyl, AC, Sunroof, Spoiler, Performance Sound System/Subwoofer. 116,000 miles<P>||||reg||1
